---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/chrome-theme-pipeline-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/chrome-theme-pipeline-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={600}
  caption="Two token sources fan in; a Zod contract gates the build; signed and self-hosted, it reaches every managed browser on the next poll."
>
  Two sources, the app's design tokens and the Figma accents, both feed the step
  that maps them to Chrome theme keys. A Zod contract validates the result; a
  renamed token fails the build loudly. Valid themes are signed with the
  project's own key and self-hosted, and managed browsers poll and auto-update.
</Diagram>
